      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>'Don't let the data get in the way of the narrative'—that's a bit of a bold way to put it. If the Fund reviewers see we missed our target by such a wide margin, won't they see through it? Can we actually claim it was a \"pivotal breakthrough\" if the numbers are technically a failure compared to what we promised?",
